    "title": "Leadership Eugene Springfield Announces 2026-27 Cohort - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jackie Flaherty ,\n7 hours ago Since 1986, the Eugene and Springfield Chambers of Commerce have promoted and fostered the development of civic leadership through Leadership Eugene Springfield (LES). This joint program prepares leaders to serve and advocate for their communities by expanding their networks, deepening their knowledge and awareness, and sharpening their leadership abilities across a wide range of topics. Participants attend monthly, full-day sessions from October to May, with the program concluding in a formal graduation. Read full article",
